            Collection for the protein sequence graph. Defaults to this graph's collection.
        name : str, optional
            Name for the protein sequence graph. Defaults to "{region} (protein)".
        strand : str, optional
            ``"forward"`` or ``"reverse"``. Inferred from the annotation when omitted.
